    "body": "I did think about that. I am not aware of a good use case for thresholds without preemption.\r\nTherefore, I believe it is fitting the preemption extension well.\r\nAlso if you wanted to use the preemption extension e.g. with an IMSIC, it would be good that this global threshold is in the preemption extension.",
